// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Timur Zinniatullin, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-18
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via RUNDLL LAUNCHER
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(EventID EQUALS "4697" AND (ServiceFileName CONTAINS "rundll32.exe" AND ServiceFileName CONTAINS "shell32.dll" AND ServiceFileName CONTAINS "shellexec_rundll" AND ServiceFileName CONTAINS "powershell"))
